---
import DesignLabLayout from '../../layouts/DesignLabLayout.astro';
import { buildOverviewVM } from '../../view-models/builders';
const vm=buildOverviewVM(); const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL; const href=(p:string)=>`${base}${p.replace(/^\//,'')}`;
---
<DesignLabLayout title="Russia-Thermal — Editorial prototype" description={vm.summary} theme="editorial">
<div class="mag">
<header><a href={href('/design-lab')}>Russia—Thermal</a><span>Research dossier · Russia × China × Smartphone thermal</span></header>
<main>
<section class="cover">
  <div class="issue">FIELD NOTE / 2026.10</div>
  <h1>{vm.title}</h1>
  <p>{vm.summary}</p>
  <div class="cover-rule"><span>Read this in 5 minutes</span><span>{vm.priorities.length} collaboration packages · {vm.stats.directions} tracked directions</span></div>
</section>
<section class="lede">
  <div class="big-letter">R</div>
  <div><p class="lead"><b>Russia is not the broad answer.</b> The useful story is narrower: a few specialist capabilities may complement China's stronger product-engineering base.</p>
  <p>That distinction changes how the whole research should be read. Institutions and papers are supporting characters; the first question is whether a capability changes a smartphone thermal-management decision.</p></div>
</section>
<section class="chapter">
  <div class="chapter-head"><span>Chapter 01</span><h2>Three bets survive</h2><p>These are not “top Russian labs.” They are bounded collaboration propositions.</p></div>
  <div class="stories">
  {vm.priorities.map((p,i)=>{const d=p.directions[0]; const inst=p.institutions[0];return <article>
    <div class="story-no">0{i+1}</div><div class="story-copy"><span>{p.rank} · {inst?.name}</span><h3>{d?.title}</h3><p>{d?.collaborationFocus ?? p.rationale}</p><blockquote>{d?.residualDifferentiation}</blockquote></div>
  </article>})}
  </div>
</section>
<section class="pullquote"><p>“China leads product engineering. Russia matters only where specialist knowledge survives that baseline.”</p></section>
<section class="chapter two">
  <div class="chapter-head"><span>Chapter 02</span><h2>The comparison that matters</h2><p>Not who is “better,” but where incremental collaboration value remains.</p></div>
  <div class="versus">
    <div><small>CHINA</small><h3>Industrial baseline</h3><p>Ultra-thin device engineering, manufacturing reliability, QA discipline and smartphone integration define the stronger product baseline.</p></div>
    <div class="vs">×</div>
    <div><small>RUSSIA</small><h3>Specialist residual</h3><p>Mechanism interpretation, long-duration capillary aging and selected process execution are the credible residuals worth testing.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="chapter">
  <div class="chapter-head"><span>Chapter 03</span><h2>What the evidence has already killed</h2><p>A research dossier is useful only if it makes rejection visible.</p></div>
  <div class="strikes">{vm.killDecisions.slice(0,5).map((d)=><article><span>{d.subject}</span><p>{d.rationale}</p></article>)}</div>
</section>
<section class="footnote">
  <div><small>METHOD</small><h2>Conclusion first. Evidence on demand.</h2><p>The underlying database remains fully traceable: Synthesis → Direction / Priority → Claim → Source.</p></div>
  <a href={href('/evidence')}>Enter evidence archive →</a>
</section>
</main>
</div>
</DesignLabLayout>
<style>
:global(body){background:#fbfaf7;color:#161616}.mag{max-width:1320px;margin:auto}header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:26px 34px;border-bottom:2px solid #111;font-family:Georgia,serif}header a{font-size:22px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none}header span{font-family:Inter,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}main{padding:0 34px 80px}.cover{padding:70px 0 28px}.issue{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;font-weight:800;color:#8c402d}.cover h1{max-width:1150px;margin:14px 0 24px;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(50px,7vw,94px);line-height:.93;letter-spacing:-.045em}.cover>p{max-width:800px;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:22px;line-height:1.5;color:#494744}.cover-rule{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;border-top:1px solid #111;border-bottom:1px solid #b8b2aa;padding:13px 0;margin-top:42px;font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em}.lede{display:grid;grid-template-columns:130px minmax(0,780px);gap:20px;padding:58px 0;margin-left:9%}.big-letter{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:130px;line-height:.72;color:#8c402d}.lede p{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.65;margin-top:0}.lede .lead{font-size:27px;line-height:1.45}.chapter{padding:62px 0;border-top:1px solid #aaa}.chapter-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:120px 1fr 320px;gap:24px;margin-bottom:42px}.chapter-head span,.story-copy>span,small{font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8c402d}.chapter-head h2{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:39px;font-weight:400;margin:0}.chapter-head p{margin:0;color:#5d5a55}.stories{margin-left:10%}.stories article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:80px 1fr;gap:20px;padding:32px 0;border-top:1px solid #c9c3ba}.story-no{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:42px;color:#a9a39b}.story-copy h3{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:34px;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0 12px}.story-copy>p{max-width:760px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.65}.story-copy blockquote{max-width:720px;margin:22px 0 0;padding-left:20px;border-left:2px solid #8c402d;font-family:Georgia,serif;color:#514d48}.pullquote{padding:90px 8%;background:#e9e3d8;margin:32px -34px}.pullquote p{max-width:1000px;margin:auto;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:clamp(34px,5vw,62px);line-height:1.08;text-align:center}.versus{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 70px 1fr;align-items:center;background:#f1eee8;padding:42px}.versus h3{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:30px;font-weight:400}.versus p{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.6}.vs{text-align:center;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:44px;color:#8c402d}.strikes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;border-top:1px solid #aaa}.strikes article{padding:25px;border-bottom:1px solid #c7c1b8}.strikes article:nth-child(odd){border-right:1px solid #c7c1b8}.strikes span{font-weight:800}.strikes p{font-family:Georgia,serif;color:#5d5852}.footnote{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:40px;padding:50px;background:#151515;color:#fff}.footnote h2{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:35px;font-weight:400;margin:6px 0}.footnote p{color:#bbb}.footnote a{white-space:nowrap}
@media(max-width:800px){header span{display:none}main{padding-inline:20px}.cover h1{font-size:48px}.cover-rule,.footnote{align-items:start;flex-direction:column}.lede{margin-left:0;grid-template-columns:70px 1fr}.big-letter{font-size:70px}.chapter-head,.versus{grid-template-columns:1fr}.vs{display:none}.stories{margin-left:0}.strikes{grid-template-columns:1fr}.strikes article:nth-child(odd){border-right:0}.pullquote{margin-inline:-20px}}
</style>